# Free email delivery for both website forms, using Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com).
# Get your access key by entering fuloranursery@gmail.com on their home page; it is emailed to you.
# Paste it after the equals sign. The key is meant to be public, so it is safe in the site's code.
# Leave it empty to run in demo mode: forms validate and show success but nothing is sent.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# Optional alternative: any URL that accepts a JSON POST. Only used when no Web3Forms key is set.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
